config BR2_PACKAGE_RPI_KERNEL_BIN
	bool "rpi-kernel-bin"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_RPI_FIRMWARE
	help
	  Raspberry Pi's own 64-bit kernel (kernel8.img), the Pi 3 Model B and B+ device trees and the
	  matching modules, taken from the firmware repository that rpi-firmware already downloads, instead
	  of building a kernel. The kernel version follows the firmware version Buildroot pins.
